{
    "title": "Dancing Cats: Duet Meow",
    "description": "Welcome to the Dancing Cats: Duet Meow - the new music rhythm game. EDM Cats: Dancing Meow! Featuring a distinctive soundtrack EDM, and design, each level is a unique musical journey and challenge!\r\n\r\nIn Dancing Cats: Duet Meow, you can enjoy super amazing and beautiful \"Cat EDM Music\" - a mix of cute \"meowing\" sound and pop music. You can experience wonderful feelings beyond your imagination with a perfect blend of beat and music. You can also experience various song styles including both global hit songs and your favorite independent music.\r\nThis game will create the whole new experience for music game lover, you can enjoy super amazing and beautiful \"Cat Music\". Hold and drag the cat to make it jump on the correct tiles.\r\nEnjoy the collection of music with a lot of trending genres. Each tap is each rhythm so that you can feel the music inside your brain.\r\nListen to the fast-beat and the melody, tap the screen to make a sharp turn, Collect star far as possible!\r\n\r\nTry EDM Dancing Cats: Duet Meow now! Music lovers will definitely love it! Immerse yourself in a 3D scene combining beautiful music and cats, you will find yourself loving this music game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Dancing Cats: Duet Meow - the new music rhythm game. EDM Cats: Dancing Meow! Featuring a distinctive soundtrack EDM, and design, each level is a unique musical journey and challenge!<br><br>In Dancing Cats: Duet Meow, you can enjoy super amazing and beautiful &quot;Cat EDM Music&quot; - a mix of cute &quot;meowing&quot; sound and pop music. You can experience wonderful feelings beyond your imagination with a perfect blend of beat and music. You can also experience various song styles including both global hit songs and your favorite independent music.<br>This game will create the whole new experience for music game lover, you can enjoy super amazing and beautiful &quot;Cat Music&quot;. Hold and drag the cat to make it jump on the correct tiles.<br>Enjoy the collection of music with a lot of trending genres. Each tap is each rhythm so that you can feel the music inside your brain.<br>Listen to the fast-beat and the melody, tap the screen to make a sharp turn, Collect star far as possible!<br><br>Try EDM Dancing Cats: Duet Meow now! Music lovers will definitely love it! Immerse yourself in a 3D scene combining beautiful music and cats, you will find yourself loving this music game.",
